§ `When can my assessment be changed`

#ASSERT NOT `Can a change in my care change my assessment` 14 30
#ASSERT `Can a change in my care change my assessment` 14 35
#ASSERT `Can a change in my care change my assessment` 13 14
#ASSERT `Can a change in my care change my assessment` 86 87

#ASSERT `May I elect to estimate my income` 59_500 70_000 FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `May I elect to estimate my income` 50_000 70_000 TRUE

`a late application that lowers my income` MEANS `My amended tax assessment` WITH
    `my adjusted taxable income went up` IS FALSE
    `I applied for the amendment by my tax return lodgement day` IS FALSE
    `I applied within 28 days after being given the tax assessment` IS FALSE
    `I applied within 28 days after becoming aware it was wrong, having been kept from it by circumstances beyond my knowledge or control` IS FALSE
    `the Registrar is satisfied that special circumstances exist` IS FALSE

`an amendment that raises my income` MEANS `My amended tax assessment` WITH
    `my adjusted taxable income went up` IS TRUE
    `I applied for the amendment by my tax return lodgement day` IS FALSE
    `I applied within 28 days after being given the tax assessment` IS FALSE
    `I applied within 28 days after becoming aware it was wrong, having been kept from it by circumstances beyond my knowledge or control` IS FALSE
    `the Registrar is satisfied that special circumstances exist` IS FALSE

`an application within 28 days of the assessment` MEANS `My amended tax assessment` WITH
    `my adjusted taxable income went up` IS FALSE
    `I applied for the amendment by my tax return lodgement day` IS FALSE
    `I applied within 28 days after being given the tax assessment` IS TRUE
    `I applied within 28 days after becoming aware it was wrong, having been kept from it by circumstances beyond my knowledge or control` IS FALSE
    `the Registrar is satisfied that special circumstances exist` IS FALSE

#ASSERT NOT `Does my amended tax assessment apply from the start` `a late application that lowers my income`
#ASSERT `Does my amended tax assessment apply from the start` `an amendment that raises my income`
#ASSERT `Does my amended tax assessment apply from the start` `an application within 28 days of the assessment`

`a second job taken after separating` MEANS `My income after separation` WITH
    `we lived together on a genuine domestic basis for at least 6 months` IS TRUE
    `we separated within the last 3 years` IS TRUE
    `we separated before the application for assessment was made` IS TRUE
    `we remain separated` IS TRUE
    `the income follows a pattern established after we first separated` IS TRUE
    `the income is of a kind not reasonably expected in the ordinary course of events` IS TRUE

`a second job, but back together` MEANS `My income after separation` WITH
    `we lived together on a genuine domestic basis for at least 6 months` IS TRUE
    `we separated within the last 3 years` IS TRUE
    `we separated before the application for assessment was made` IS TRUE
    `we remain separated` IS FALSE
    `the income follows a pattern established after we first separated` IS TRUE
    `the income is of a kind not reasonably expected in the ordinary course of events` IS TRUE

`a second job, after only 4 months together` MEANS `My income after separation` WITH
    `we lived together on a genuine domestic basis for at least 6 months` IS FALSE
    `we separated within the last 3 years` IS TRUE
    `we separated before the application for assessment was made` IS TRUE
    `we remain separated` IS TRUE
    `the income follows a pattern established after we first separated` IS TRUE
    `the income is of a kind not reasonably expected in the ordinary course of events` IS TRUE

#ASSERT `May I apply to exclude post-separation income` `a second job taken after separating`
#ASSERT NOT `May I apply to exclude post-separation income` `a second job, but back together`
#ASSERT NOT `May I apply to exclude post-separation income` `a second job, after only 4 months together`

#ASSERT `What is the lowest my income can be set at for post-separation income` 70_000 EQUALS 49000

`a departure for a ground the Registrar accepts` MEANS `My departure application` WITH
    `an administrative assessment is in force` IS TRUE
    `the Registrar is satisfied a ground for departure in s 117(2) exists` IS TRUE
    `the Registrar is satisfied it would be just and equitable and otherwise proper` IS TRUE
    `the rate sought is below the minimum annual rate` IS FALSE
    `my percentage of care` IS 5

`a departure below the minimum rate with no regular care` MEANS `My departure application` WITH
    `an administrative assessment is in force` IS TRUE
    `the Registrar is satisfied a ground for departure in s 117(2) exists` IS TRUE
    `the Registrar is satisfied it would be just and equitable and otherwise proper` IS TRUE
    `the rate sought is below the minimum annual rate` IS TRUE
    `my percentage of care` IS 5

`a departure below the minimum rate with regular care` MEANS `My departure application` WITH
    `an administrative assessment is in force` IS TRUE
    `the Registrar is satisfied a ground for departure in s 117(2) exists` IS TRUE
    `the Registrar is satisfied it would be just and equitable and otherwise proper` IS TRUE
    `the rate sought is below the minimum annual rate` IS TRUE
    `my percentage of care` IS 14

